{% comment %}
  10 — JOURNAL
{% endcomment %}

<section class="section-padding border-top-thin" id="journal">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);" class="gsap-reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="editorial-label">10 — THE JOURNAL</span>
        <h2 class="headline-section font-serif" style="margin-top: 12px;">OLFACTORY CHRONICLES</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="#" class="btn-secondary">READ ALL ARTICLES →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3 gsap-reveal">
      <!-- Article 1 -->
      <article class="journal-card">
        <div class="journal-card-image">
          <img src="{{ 'hero_perfume_bottle.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Journal 1">
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="editorial-label">ESSAY · ISSUE 04</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif" style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 8px;">THE ARCHITECTURE OF WEARING SCENT IN WINTER</h3>
          <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.6;">
            Why heavy molecular resins react to cold air currents and wool fibers differently than lightweight summer florals.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Article 2 -->
      <article class="journal-card">
        <div class="journal-card-image">
          <img src="{{ 'bestseller_oud_royal.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Journal 2">
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="editorial-label">MASTERCLASS · ISSUE 03</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif" style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 8px;">THE BOTANICAL PROVENANCE OF ASSAM OUD</h3>
          <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.6;">
            Inside the sustainable agro-forestry reserves of Assam where 50-year-old Aquilaria trees produce rare agarwood resin.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Article 3 -->
      <article class="journal-card">
        <div class="journal-card-image">
          <img src="{{ 'discovery_box.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Journal 3">
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="editorial-label">INTERVIEW · ISSUE 02</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif" style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 8px;">THE ART OF MACERATION: A DIALOGUE WITH OUR MASTER NOSE</h3>
          <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.6;">
            Exploring why resting raw fragrance compounds in cold dark rooms for 90 days unlocks sensory depth.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
